  "keyFeatures": [
    "Multi-cloud GPU provisioning across AWS, GCP, Azure, Lambda, Nebius, and more",
    "Kubernetes and bare-metal SSH fleet support",
    "Dev environments with VS Code/JupyterLab integration",
    "Distributed training tasks with multi-node support",
    "Scalable model serving with auto-scaling and HTTPS gateways",
    "Persistent volumes for model and data caching",
    "NVIDIA, AMD, Google TPU, and Tenstorrent accelerator support",
    "AI agent skills for automated fleet and workload management",
    "Python API and REST HTTP API"
